"“Business, my dear. Business does not sleep.”": "“Business, my dear. Business no dey sleep.”",
"“Madam, take the small boy and go.”": "“Madam, carry the small boy and go.”",
"“If found, return to Etim family, Ikot Ekpene.”": "“If you find am, return am to Etim family, Ikot Ekpene.”",
